{"path":"io/manip/showbase","title":"std::showbase, std::noshowbase","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>showbase, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>noshowbase","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/manip/showbase","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"This is an I/O manipulator, it may be called with an expression such as out << std::showbase for any out of type std::basic_ostream or with an expression such as in >> std::showbase for any in of type std::basic_istream.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ios\">&lt;ios&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> showbase<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> noshowbase<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Enables the <code>showbase</code> flag in the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> as if by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str.<span class=\"me1\">setf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1708\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Disables the <code>showbase</code> flag in the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> as if by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str.<span class=\"me1\">unsetf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1708\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<p>This is an I/O manipulator, it may be called with an expression such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></code> for any <code>out</code> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> or with an expression such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></code> for any <code>in</code> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream\">std::basic_istream</a></span>.\n</p><p>The <code>showbase</code> flag affects the behavior of integer output (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/num_put/put\">std::num_put::put</a></span>), monetary input (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/money_get/get\">std::money_get::get</a></span>) and monetary output (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/money_put/put\">std::money_put::put</a></span>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> str\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> reference to I/O stream\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> (reference to the stream after manipulation).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>As specifed in <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/num_put/put\">std::num_put::put</a></span>, the showbase flag in integer output acts like the # format specifier in <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fprintf\">std::printf</a></span>, which means the numeric base prefix is <i>not</i> added when outputting the value zero.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// showbase affects the output of octals and hexadecimals</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1797\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hex</span></span></a>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"showbase: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showbase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"noshowbase: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">noshowbase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// and both input and output of monetary values</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/global\"><span class=\"kw2699\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">global</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1909\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.UTF8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> val <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istringstream\"><span class=\"kw1752\">std::<span class=\"me2\">istringstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"3.14\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showbase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/get_money\"><span class=\"kw1813\">std::<span class=\"me2\">get_money</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>val<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"With showbase, parsing 3.14 as money gives \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> val <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istringstream\"><span class=\"kw1752\">std::<span class=\"me2\">istringstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"3.14\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">noshowbase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/get_money\"><span class=\"kw1813\">std::<span class=\"me2\">get_money</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>val<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Without showbase, parsing 3.14 as money gives \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> val <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>showbase: 0x2a\nnoshowbase: 2a\nWith showbase, parsing 3.14 as money gives 0\nWithout showbase, parsing 3.14 as money gives 314</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/resetiosflags\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>resetiosflags</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  clears the specified ios_base flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setiosflags\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setiosflags</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the specified <code>ios_base</code> flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/manip","title":"Input/output manipulators"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::showbase, std::noshowbase","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Enables the showbase flag in the stream str as if by calling str.setf(std::ios_base::showbase)."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"str"},{"label":"Return value","note":"str (reference to the stream after manipulation)."},{"label":"Notes","note":"As specifed in std::num_put::put, the showbase flag in integer output acts like the # format specifier in std::printf, which means the numeric base prefix is…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"resetiosflags","note":"clears the specified ios_base flags"},{"label":"setiosflags","note":"sets the specified ios_base flags"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":284,"codeBlockCount":2}
